      "value": "@{5f3477471c7a477bc948affb|full_name} Yes this. Pickup default is actually incredibly bad on what have been the \"Standard VR Controllers\" (The Oculus/Steam Layout and Not Vive Wands). I've previously (2023) brought up on here that if a player is using Vive Wands, this should be readable in Udon so we can switch to a separate, secondary control scheme for control-intensive features since the usage considerations for Vive Wands are irreconcilably different from everything else.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
